    <ul>
      <li>Collected Items: Full Name, Mobile Phone Number</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. Purpose of Collection and Use</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Processing registrations and schedule inquiries for the F45 Seongsu 7-Day Trial Pass</li>
      <li>Sending booking confirmations, visit instructions, and essential studio updates via SMS/Call</li>
